{"version":1,"content":"<p>英皇女歌手鄧小巧將於12月18日及19日，在新蒲崗PORTAL舉行一連兩場《Before Bedtime音樂會》。</p><p>鄧小巧今天（15日）推出全新廣東作品《成為了我不喜歡的大人》，唱出成年人在成長路上取捨、轉變與自我和解。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:20:55.260896+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:44:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:35.236392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:17:39.807628+00:00","content_hash":"bdc12790e38e0ec6b12025e8a4fed755eea946ba795afdf027ea89fb4ac53aef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}